"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". The Audio-Radial Stunner shuts down if the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," is deactivated or destroyed.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
